244-styles-71e50621-f0f3-4a8c-9b18-55b8dd211253-attributes-lineheight:125%;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-71e50621-f0f3-4a8c-9b18-55b8dd211253-attributes-textshadow:undefined;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-71e50621-f0f3-4a8c-9b18-55b8dd211253-attributes-textstroke:undefined;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-71e50621-f0f3-4a8c-9b18-55b8dd211253-attributes-letterspacing:0px;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-71e50621-f0f3-4a8c-9b18-55b8dd211253-attributes-texttransform:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p><strong>Source:</strong>&nbsp;Eur J Clin Invest, 2006.</p></span></div></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="5a3b5d60-7aca-4bb7-a746-68ca71c86a65" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0" class="r-1vrtnhx alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-e2bf30c6-7292-47b6-96b1-1bb9a4ff7feb-attributes-color:#2A2A2A;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-e2bf30c6-7292-47b6-96b1-1bb9a4ff7feb-attributes-fontsize:17px;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-e2bf30c6-7292-47b6-96b1-1bb9a4ff7feb-attributes-textdecoration:undefined;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-e2bf30c6-7292-47b6-96b1-1bb9a4ff7feb-attributes-textalign:center;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-e2bf30c6-7292-47b6-96b1-1bb9a4ff7feb-attributes-fontfamily:Quicksand;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-e2bf30c6-7292-47b6-96b1-1bb9a4ff7feb-attributes-fontweight:400;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-e2bf30c6-7292-47b6-96b1-1bb9a4ff7feb-attributes-lineheight:125%;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-e2bf30c6-7292-47b6-96b1-1bb9a4ff7feb-attributes-textshadow:undefined;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-e2bf30c6-7292-47b6-96b1-1bb9a4ff7feb-attributes-textstroke:undefined;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-e2bf30c6-7292-47b6-96b1-1bb9a4ff7feb-attributes-letterspacing:0px;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-e2bf30c6-7292-47b6-96b1-1bb9a4ff7feb-attributes-texttransform:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p><b><u>So, what does this mean?<br></u></b><br><br>If your bloating doesn’t follow a cycle-related pattern and doesn’t show up in the week or two before your period, then these three triggers likely aren’t the cause.<br><br><br>But if you consistently feel bloated, heavier, or experience sudden weight swings and cravings before your period starts, no restrictive diets, exercise alone, or standard debloating supplements will fix it — because they don’t address the root of the issue.<br><br><br><b><u>The good news?
